### All events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events

### Search
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?q=game

### One event
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/2

### Event that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/999

### Create an event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pierogi workshop",
  "date": "2026-12-03T17:00",
  "location": "Student kitchen",
  "capacity": 15
}

### Invalid event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "date": "tomorrow", "capacity": -5 }

### Update event 4
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/events/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pierogi workshop",
  "date": "2026-12-03T17:00",
  "location": "Student kitchen",
  "capacity": 20
}

### Delete event 4
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/events/3

### Delete event that does not exist
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/events/999

### Event list
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stats

### Invalid: past date
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Past event",
  "date": "2020-01-01T10:00",
  "location": "Student club",
  "capacity": 20
}

### Invalid: title too long
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT TT",
  "date": "2026-12-03T17:00",
  "location": "Student club",
  "capacity": 20
}

### Invalid: location too long
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Workshop",
  "date": "2026-12-03T17:00",
  "location": "TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT",
  "capacity": 20
}

### Invalid: description too long
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Workshop",
  "date": "2026-12-03T17:00",
  "description": "",
  "location": "Student club",
  "capacity": 20
}

### Invalid: past date and long title 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT",
  "date": "2020-01-01T10:00",
  "location": "Student club",
  "capacity": 20
}

### Invalid date filter - tomorrow
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?from=tomorrow